<p><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Endless%20Adventures%20Main%20Page" title="Endless Adventures Main Page">Endless Adventures Main Page</a>
</p><p>Besides allowing the creation of dwarf mages, Endless Adventures has three new background options. All of these are for flavor purposes only: none will offer gameplay benefits unless a specific EAP references them.
</p>
